{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27611","headline":"观杨瑗柘枝 · 张祜","name":"观杨瑗柘枝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"促叠蛮鼍引柘枝，卷檐虚帽带交垂。\n紫罗衫宛蹲身处，红锦靴柔踏节时。\n微动翠蛾抛旧态，缓遮檀口唱新词。\n看看舞罢轻云起，却赴襄王梦里期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27611.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27611","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}